      "en": "“‘Notwithstanding, no devoted thing that a man devotes to the LORD of all that he has, whether of man or animal, or of the field of his possession, shall be sold or redeemed. Everything that is permanently devoted is most holy to the LORD.",
      "ko": "오직 여호와께 아주 바친 그 물건은 사람이든지 생축이든지 기업의 밭이든지 팔지도 못하고 속하지도 못하나니 바친 것은 다 여호와께 지극히 거룩함이며",
      "source_text_hash": "966e839dc6efe0142c9c83c79ff11b21631dc74604d86874b952e91591f1f69e",
      "translation_text_hash": "037dc2e96980969a4b1fdf6d45386d9f4b3ac80dee12ef916c55064a536a3164",
